  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/IMG_4629.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La tienda est&aacute; situada en la avenida Catalunya de Onda, esquina calle Ben-Al-Abbar. Este jueves, con motivo del primer aniversario se han sorteado dos vales de 30&euro; a gastar en tienda, que han correspondido a Lola Soler y a Lidia Ruiz C&oacute;zar.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4581.jpg\" alt=\"img_4581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4582.jpg\" alt=\"img_4582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4583.jpg\" alt=\"img_4583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4584.jpg\" alt=\"img_4584\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4586.jpg\" alt=\"img_4586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4589.jpg\" alt=\"img_4589\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4592.jpg\" alt=\"img_4592\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4593.jpg\" alt=\"img_4593\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1eraniversarimodaycomplementosgarcia/img_4594.